  "details": "Like it looks pretty, but my menu keeps crashing me and I've already restarted my headset 5 times because my quest can't handle the animations. I can't see the status of people I have blocked which is usually how I see if my old friends are ok because we're just taking a break from seeing each other. That's honestly a feature you didn't need to get rid of at all and I don't know why it's gone now. It's way too cluttered and confusing to navigate. It looks way too much like Discord, it looked better when it was its own thing. The banners merge with the nametags, making the banners unreadable. The yellow box around the nametag when you talk is really ugly and I wish it just stayed blue or you could color it. Not being able to turn off/set back to your colors (If you have your menu black, the profile would be black) in other people's profiles is a really big issue because I can't read green on red or red on black and more and I now can't read a lot of people's bio's or anything.",
